<view class="page">
  <view class="header">
    <view class="brand">小甘</view>
    <view class="subtitle">兰州话 ↔ 普通话 · 试运行</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{serviceOffline}}" class="demo-banner offline">
    连不上后端服务：语音翻译暂不可用，常用句仍可离线使用。
  </view>
  <view wx:elif="{{demoMode}}" class="demo-banner">{{demoText}}</view>

  <view class="direction-row">
    <view
      class="direction-card {{direction === 'dialect' ? 'active' : ''}}"
      data-dir="dialect"
      bindtap="onSelectDirection"
    >
      <view class="dir-title">听兰州话</view>
      <view class="dir-desc">按住说一句，转成普通话文字和语音</view>
    </view>
    <view
      class="direction-card {{direction === 'mandarin' ? 'active' : ''}}"
      data-dir="mandarin"
      bindtap="onSelectDirection"
    >
      <view class="dir-title">说普通话</view>
      <view class="dir-desc">输入普通话，生成兰州话文字和语音</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="scenario-row">
    <view
      wx:for="{{scenarios}}"
      wx:key="id"
      class="chip {{scenario === item.id ? 'active' : ''}}"
      data-id="{{item.id}}"
      bindtap="onSelectScenario"
    >{{item.label}}</view>
  </view>

  <block wx:if="{{direction === 'dialect'}}">
    <view class="talk-panel">
      <view
        class="talk-button {{state === 'recording' ? 'is-recording' : ''}} {{busy ? 'is-busy' : ''}}"
        bindtouchstart="onPressStart"
        bindtouchend="onPressEnd"
        bindtouchcancel="onPressEnd"
      >
        <view class="talk-icon">{{state === 'recording' ? '●' : '🎙'}}</view>
        <view class="talk-text">{{statusText}}</view>
        <view class="talk-sub">{{state === 'recording' ? '松开后自动翻译' : '按住说话 · 最长 30 秒'}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="talk-note">录音只用于本次翻译，处理完即删除；日志不记录原话。</view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <block wx:else>
    <view class="card compose">
      <textarea
        class="compose-input"
        placeholder="输入一句普通话，例如：医生，我有点头晕。"
        value="{{textInput}}"
        bindinput="onTextInput"
        maxlength="200"
        auto-height
        cursor-spacing="24"
      />
      <button class="primary-btn compose-btn" bindtap="onGenerateDialect" disabled="{{busy}}">
        {{busy ? '正在生成…' : '生成兰州话'}}
      </button>
    </view>
  </block>

  <view wx:if="{{hintText}}" class="hint">{{hintText}}</view>

  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="card error-card">
    <view class="error-title">{{error.title}}</view>
    <view class="error-message">{{error.message}}</view>
    <view class="error-actions">
      <button wx:if="{{error.retryable}}" class="mini-btn" size="mini" bindtap="onRetry">重试上传</button>
      <button wx:if="{{error.showSettings}}" class="mini-btn" size="mini" bindtap="onOpenPermissionSettings">打开设置</button>
      <button wx:if="{{error.canEdit}}" class="mini-btn mini-primary" size="mini" bindtap="onTapEdit">改文字</button>
      <button class="mini-btn" size="mini" bindtap="onDismissError">重说</button>
      <button class="mini-btn" size="mini" bindtap="onUsePhrases">用常用句</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{result}}" class="dialog">
    <view class="bubble left">
      <view class="bubble-tag">{{result.inputTag}}</view>
      <view class="bubble-text">{{result.inputText}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="bubble right">
      <view class="bubble-tag">{{result.outputTag}}</view>
      <block wx:if="{{editing}}">
        <textarea
          class="edit-input"
          value="{{editText}}"
          bindinput="onEditInput"
          auto-height
          maxlength="200"
          focus="{{true}}"
        />
        <view class="edit-actions">
          <button class="mini-btn" size="mini" bindtap="onCancelEdit">取消</button>
          <button class="mini-btn mini-primary" size="mini" bindtap="onConfirmEdit">重新翻译</button>
        </view>
        <view class="edit-hint">正在修改“{{result.inputTag}}”这句。</view>
      </block>
      <block wx:else>
        <view class="bubble-text output">{{result.outputText}}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{result.backTranslation}}" class="back-translation">回译：{{result.backTranslation}}</view>
      </block>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{result.needsConfirmation}}" class="notice warn">
      这句把握不大，先让对方看文字；点“改字”确认后再播放。
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{result.ttsFailed}}" class="notice warn">
      方言语音暂时没生成，先用文字沟通。
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{result.demo}}" class="notice demo">
      演示模式：这条转写来自内置语料，不是真实识别。
    </view>

    <view class="result-actions">
      <button class="action-btn" bindtap="onPlayResult" disabled="{{!result.audioUrl}}">
        {{result.playLabel}}
      </button>
      <button class="action-btn" bindtap="onResay">{{direction === 'dialect' ? '重说' : '重输'}}</button>
      <button class="action-btn" bindtap="onTapEdit">改字</button>
    </view>
    <view class="audio-note">AI 生成语音 · 音频链接 1 小时后失效</view>
  </view>

  <view class="bottom-nav">
    <view class="nav-item" bindtap="onOpenPhrases">常用句</view>
    <view class="nav-item" bindtap="onOpenSettings">设置</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{showMicIntro}}" class="mask" catchtouchmove="noop">
    <view class="modal">
      <view class="modal-title">需要麦克风</view>
      <view class="modal-text">
        按住说话后，我们用麦克风录下这一句兰州话，只用于本次翻译，处理完即删除。
        日志不会记录你的原话，也可以随时在设置里删除本次记录。
      </view>
      <button class="primary-btn" bindtap="onConfirmMicIntro">知道了，开始使用</button>
      <button class="text-btn" bindtap="onCancelMicIntro">先用常用句</button>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
